<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 625.97, up 0.11.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.03.</p>
<p>Declines beat advances 296 to 224.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 23,091,340 compared with 21,020,005 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
